Supermarket Sales Analysis

Project Overview

This project analyzes supermarket sales data using Microsoft Excel. The goal is to identify sales trends, evaluate product profitability, compare branch performance, and generate actionable business insights.

Dataset

The dataset contains 500 sales transactions and includes:

3 Branches

3 Cities

4 Product Categories

28 Products

Payment Methods

Customer Types

