Key Business Insights

Category Performance: Food generated the highest revenue, reaching 21,622.40.

Profitability: Household achieved the highest gross profit margin at 34.96%.

Product Performance: Trash Bags generated the highest gross profit at 1,775.28.

Branch Performance: Branch A generated the highest revenue among the three branches.

Monthly Trends: May recorded the highest monthly revenue at 8,040.43.

